WEBVTT

00:01:57.413 --> 00:02:01.038
the book Emotional Agility in 2017.

00:02:01.038 --> 00:02:05.913
She gave a talk at TED Women that seemed
to touch a lot of people very deeply.

00:02:06.288 --> 00:02:08.288
And I think it's because she
talks about something

00:02:08.288 --> 00:02:14.579
a lot of us need to hear that we should
accept the full range of our emotions.

00:02:15.496 --> 00:02:19.246
This is hard enough to do in life and
can be even more complicated in

00:02:19.246 --> 00:02:24.788
a workplace. So stick around after the
talk and I'll dissect those tears

00:02:24.788 --> 00:02:29.579
I experienced and explore how we can pay
attention to our emotions at work in

00:02:29.579 --> 00:02:31.538
a way that makes our work better.